Package: Stan2R
Title: Convert Stan Models into Generative R Code
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Nik", "Vetr", email = "nikgvetr@stanford.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Translates Stan programs into R scripts for prior and posterior
    predictive simulation, pointwise predictive densities, and calibration
    checks, using the Stan compiler (stanc) as the parser.
License: TBD (no license chosen yet; see README)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: graphics, grDevices, stats
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), withr, jsonlite, cmdstanr, posterior, viridisLite
Config/testthat/edition: 3
SystemRequirements: CmdStan (provides the stanc compiler)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
